    <string name="about">The story moves forward one incident a day, kanda by kanda, from Narada\'s story of the perfect man to Rama\'s last journey, then starts again. Every incident has a classical painting, included in the app: works by Raja Ravi Varma, the Mewar Ramayana, Pahari and Mughal folios and more, from Wikimedia Commons. Each painting\'s artist, licence and source are shown under its story.</string>
